cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Distractor_software: Automated maze-task distractor generation for English, German, and Arabic"
abstract: >-
  Distractor_software generates maze-task distractor stimuli for psycholinguistic
  experiments in English, German, and Arabic. Built on Transformer-based language
  models (GPT-2), the pipeline selects real-word distractors that are contextually
  implausible while matching the target word in length and frequency range.
